# NLW Proxy — example proxy list
#
# Copy this file to `webshare-01.txt` (or any *.txt name) inside data/proxies/
# and replace with your real proxies. NLW Proxy auto-loads every *.txt file in
# this folder on startup, deduplicates by host:port, then health-tests them.
#
# Supported formats (one proxy per line):
#   host:port
#   host:port:username:password        (authenticated — recommended)
#   http://host:port
#   http://username:password@host:port
#   socks5://host:port
#
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Example (these are NOT real, replace them):
# 203.0.113.10:8080:user1:pass1
# 203.0.113.11:8080:user1:pass1
# socks5://198.51.100.5:1080
